                "text": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2024-47081](https://osv.dev/CVE-2024-47081)**\n(Also published as: [PYSEC-2026-1872](https://osv.dev/PYSEC-2026-1872), [GHSA-9hjg-9r4m-mvj7](https://osv.dev/GHSA-9hjg-9r4m-mvj7), ).\n\n## [PYSEC-2026-1872](https://osv.dev/PYSEC-2026-1872)\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eDetails\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n\u003e ### Impact\n\u003e \n\u003e Due to a URL parsing issue, Requests releases prior to 2.32.4 may leak .netrc credentials to third parties for specific maliciously-crafted URLs.\n\u003e \n\u003e ### Workarounds\n\u003e For older versions of Requests, use of the .netrc file can be disabled with `trust_env=False` on your Requests Session ([docs](https://requests.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/#requests.Session.trust_env)).\n\u003e \n\u003e ### References\n\u003e https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/6965\n\u003e https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/2\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n## [GHSA-9hjg-9r4m-mvj7](https://osv.dev/GHSA-9hjg-9r4m-mvj7)\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eDetails\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n\u003e ### Impact\n\u003e \n\u003e Due to a URL parsing issue, Requests releases prior to 2.32.4 may leak .netrc credentials to third parties for specific maliciously-crafted URLs.\n\u003e \n\u003e ### Workarounds\n\u003e For older versions of Requests, use of the .netrc file can be disabled with `trust_env=False` on your Requests Session ([docs](https://requests.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/#requests.Session.trust_env)).\n\u003e \n\u003e ### References\n\u003e https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/6965\n\u003e https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/2\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n---\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/src/lab5-canary/requirements.txt | requests | 2.19.1 |\n\n## Remediation\n\nTo fix these vulnerabilities, update the vulnerabilities past the listed fixed versions below.\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n